      "langue": "en",
      "text": "&quot;Treasure Heroes: The Legend of Light and Darkness&quot; is a role-playing game developed and published by game manufacturer Alien Technology (aka Waixing). Hidopark is an ancient and beautiful country. There are seven national treasures in the city. However, on a night of lightning and thunder, the treasures were stolen and the princess disappeared. Players will play the role of a hero to slay demons, retrieve gems, and rescue the princess."
